{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31334","headline":"续梦中十韵 · 郑颢","name":"续梦中十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"间岁流虹节，归轩出禁扃。\n奔波陶畏景，萧洒梦殊庭。\n境象非曾到，崇严昔未经。\n日斜乌敛翼，风动鹤飘翎。\n异苑人争集，凉台笔不停。\n石门雾露白，玉殿莓苔青。\n若匪灾先兆，何缘思入冥。\n御炉虚仗马，华盖负云亭。\n白日成千古，金縢閟九龄。\n小臣哀绝笔，湖上泣青萍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑颢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31334.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31334","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}